CONCLUSION: PASS. Every numbered design-contract item verified against
real data (Travel & vacations case) and against master byte-for-byte for
positive-wedge parity; every enumerated boundary (limit, limit+1,
all-negative, zero-total) exercised and holds with no NaN/Inf and no
sign-inversion; no un-enumerated consumer found; the one asymmetry found
(Unmatched can silently disappear) is outside this spec's stated
contract and is reported as a backlog observation, not a defect in this
task's own scope.
